# macOS libraries — machine-specific symlinks, same situation as ../lib-sim/.
#
# Created by the macOS/appleMain work (see the macos-build-and-apple-source-set
# branch) and left behind when switching branches, which is how this directory
# turned up untracked *and* unignored on main — one `git add .` away from being
# committed. Nothing here belongs in git.
#
# See ../JamiBridge/README.md for the setup.
*
!.gitignore
